  "description": {
    "raw": "An object you touch emanates a 20-foot radius of bright light. The effect looks like a regular flame but creates no heat and uses no oxygen. Allies within the area of this light gain a +2 enhancement bonus on Perception and Sense Motive checks, as well as on Knowledge checks to identify monsters that are also within the area and their special powers and vulnerabilities.\n\nWhen an inquisitor casts this spell, the light emanation doubles (40-ft.-radius emanation) while that inquisitor has a judgment active.\n\nLight spells counter and dispel darkness spells of an equal or lower level.",
    "search_text": "\"an object you touch emanates a 20-foot radius of bright light. the effect looks like a regular flame but creates no heat and uses no oxygen. allies within the area of this light gain a +2 enhancement bonus on perception and sense motive checks, as well as on knowledge checks to identify monsters that are also within the area and their special powers and vulnerabilities.\\n\\nwhen an inquisitor casts this spell, the light emanation doubles (40-ft.-radius emanation) while that inquisitor has a judgment active.\\n\\nlight spells counter and dispel darkness spells of an equal or lower level.\"",
